category: Libs
requires: libcurl-devel libssl-devel libyubihsm2 pkg-config
sdesc: "C library to expose low- and high-level functions to interact with a YubiHSM (development)"
ldesc: "This repository contains most of the components used to interact with the
YubiHSM 2 at both a user-facing and programmatic level."
external-source: yubihsm-shell

